    <p3>Hi! Thank you for visiting my website! My name is Amelia, I'm 23 years old, and, I'm originally from Nebraska!
        However, I've also lived in Washington and, soon, Colorado!
        I'm married to an amazing man, and, together, we have one amazing daughter! You could say we're an amazing family!
        In my spare time, I like to read, draw, watch anime,and hang out doing just about anything with my family!
        I have a ridiculous sweet tooth, I'll never say no to dessert! Or iced coffee.
